          "text": "Oops! If we use the \"Next costume\" command multiple times in a row, the costumes will change too quickly and we will not see how they change: it will be like nothing is happening. To prevent commands from being executed almost simultaneously, we insert a \"pause.\" To do this, we need the \"Wait __ sec\" command.",
